---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="页面未找到" description="你访问的页面不存在。">
  <section class="hero" style="text-align:center">
    <div class="hero-inner" style="max-width:none">
      <span class="hero-kicker">404 · Lost in the fog</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title">这里没有你要找的页面</h1>
      <p class="hero-description" style="margin-inline:auto">
        也许链接已经搬家，或者它从未存在过。不如回到首页，重新出发。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/blog">查看文章</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
